      "source": "https://einvoice1.gst.gov.in/Others/MasterCodes",
      "verified": true,
      "note": "Names other than codes 28 and 99 follow the e-invoice MasterCodes table opened 2026-11-01. Code 26 is labelled Dadra and Nagar Haveli there. Code 28 is not in that table; SPEC §1.1 requires accepting undivided Andhra Pradesh with a legacy warning. Code 25 is in the table and takes the same warning. Code 96 is a place-of-supply code and is not a GSTIN prefix. That table labels 99 OTHER COUNTRIES, the same label it gives 96; this pack labels 99 Centre Jurisdiction because SPEC §1.1 defines 99 as centre jurisdiction / NRTP / OIDAR. e-way bill list: https://docs.ewaybillgst.gov.in/apidocs/state-code.html (cited by SPEC as checked 2026-11-01; the build environment received HTTP 403)."
